Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:46:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: GPU time per render pass with MCLA_GPU_TIMES=1

Every render pass writes a timestamp as it begins and ends when the
variable is set and the adapter has timestamp queries; the frame's
queries are read back after its submit and every 3 seconds the log gets
the frame's GPU time and the passes that took the most, by source line.
The log also says whether the adapter takes BC textures.
